@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Supplier Clarifications

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Supplier Portal
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Supplier ↔ Sourcing Officer clarification threads.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Supplier (own company only, Admin-approved)

ROUTE: /Supplier/Clarifications

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Own threads only; new question linked to an own invitation
  or offer.
- Thread view is the shared Clarifications/Details page.

DEPENDENCIES:
Clarifications, ClarificationMessages, Notifications.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Every query must be filtered by the signed-in user’s
SupplierId. Never show other suppliers’ invitations, offers,
prices or evaluations.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Supplier Clarifications";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Clarifications";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Questions between your company and the Sourcing Officer.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-clarifications">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-clarifications">Clarifications</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Subject</th><th scope="col">Tender / offer</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Opened</th><th scope="col">Last message</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No clarifications yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="" asp-controller="Clarifications" asp-action="Details">Open a thread</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
